{"slug": "kubbervik-scallops", "nyt_id": 11165, "url": "https://cooking.nytimes.com/recipes/11165-kubbervik-scallops", "name": "Kubbervik Scallops", "author": "Jonathan Reynolds", "description": "", "servings": {"text": "4 servings", "min": 4, "max": 4, "yield_type": "servings"}, "time": {"prep_minutes": null, "cook_minutes": null, "total_minutes": 10, "raw": {"total": "10 minutes"}}, "ingredients": [{"position": 1, "raw": "3 tablespoons butter", "group": null, "quantity": 3.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tbsp", "item": "butter", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 2, "raw": "12 fat sea scallops, with coral attached, if possible", "group": null, "quantity": 12.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": null, "item": "fat sea scallops", "preparation": "with coral attached, if possible", "optional": false}, {"position": 3, "raw": "Salt and freshly ground pepper to taste", "group": null, "quantity": null, "quantity_max": null, "unit": null, "item": "salt and freshly ground pepper to taste", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 4, "raw": "1 ¼ cups dry white wine", "group": null, "quantity": 1.25, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "cup", "item": "dry white wine", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 5, "raw": "2 tablespoons fish stock (see recipe)", "group": null, "quantity": 2.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tbsp", "item": "fish stock (see recipe)", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 6, "raw": "1 ¼ cups heavy cream", "group": null, "quantity": 1.25, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "cup", "item": "heavy cream", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 7, "raw": "1 tablespoon lemon juice", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tbsp", "item": "lemon juice", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 8, "raw": "½ teaspoon saffron threads", "group": null, "quantity": 0.5, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tsp", "item": "saffron threads", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 9, "raw": "¼ cup minced chives", "group": null, "quantity": 0.25, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "cup", "item": "minced chives", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 10, "raw": "Cracked pink peppercorns for garnish", "group": null, "quantity": null, "quantity_max": null, "unit": null, "item": "cracked pink peppercorns for garnish", "preparation": null, "optional": false}], "steps": [{"position": 1, "text": "Melt the butter in a large skillet over high heat. Season the scallops with salt and pepper and saute until lightly browned, about 1 minute per side. Remove the scallops and set aside. Pour the butter and liquid that remains into a saucepan."}, {"position": 2, "text": "Add the wine, stock, cream, lemon juice and saffron to the reserved liquid in the saucepan and reduce over medium heat by about half, until you have a rich sauce. Season to taste with salt."}, {"position": 3, "text": "Gently reheat the scallops in the sauce and stir in the chives. Serve immediately, sprinkled with the pink peppercorns."}], "nutrition": {"calories": 448.2, "protein_g": 11.8, "carbohydrates_g": 7.8, "fat_g": 36.0, "saturated_fat_g": 22.6, "trans_fat_g": 0.9, "cholesterol_mg": 125.0, "sodium_mg": 579.5, "fiber_g": 0.5, "sugar_g": 3.0, "unsaturated_fat_g": 10.9, "source": "nyt", "basis": "per_serving", "computed_with": null}, "tags": {"cuisine": [], "diet": ["gluten-free"], "course": ["main course"], "meal": ["dinner"], "occasion": [], "other": ["saute", "scallop", "seafood"]}, "images": [], "rating": {"average": 5.0, "count": 7}, "video_url": null, "comment_count": null, "published_at": "2003-07-27", "scraped_at": "2026-09-07T02:06:40.278223+00:00", "scraper_version": "1.0.0"}
{"slug": "kugelhopf", "nyt_id": 4207, "url": "https://cooking.nytimes.com/recipes/4207-kugelhopf", "name": "Kugelhopf", "author": "Florence Fabricant", "description": "Florence Fabricant", "servings": {"text": "12 to 16 servings", "min": 12, "max": 16, "yield_type": "servings"}, "time": {"prep_minutes": 25, "cook_minutes": 45, "total_minutes": 70, "raw": {"total": "1 hour 10 minutes", "prep": "25 minutes", "cook": "45 minutes"}}, "ingredients": [{"position": 1, "raw": "1 cup raisins", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "cup", "item": "raisins", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 2, "raw": "⅓ cup Cognac", "group": null, "quantity": 0.3333333333333333, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "cup", "item": "cognac", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 3, "raw": "½ cup plus 3 tablespoons sugar", "group": null, "quantity": 0.5, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "cup", "item": "plus 3 tablespoons sugar", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 4, "raw": "1 package active dry yeast", "group": null, "quantity": 1.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "package", "item": "active dry yeast", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 5, "raw": "1 ¼ cups warm milk", "group": null, "quantity": 1.25, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "cup", "item": "warm milk", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 6, "raw": "¾ teaspoon salt", "group": null, "quantity": 0.75, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "tsp", "item": "salt", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 7, "raw": "4 ¼ cups flour (approximately)", "group": null, "quantity": 4.25, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "cup", "item": "flour (approximately)", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 8, "raw": "5 ounces plus 1 tablespoon soft unsalted butter", "group": null, "quantity": 5.0, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "oz", "item": "plus 1 tablespoon soft unsalted butter", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 9, "raw": "¾ cup blanched slivered almonds", "group": null, "quantity": 0.75, "quantity_max": null, "unit": "cup", "item": "blanched slivered almonds", "preparation": null, "optional": false}, {"position": 10, "raw": "Confectioners' sugar", "group": null, "quantity": null, "quantity_max": null, "unit": null, "item": "confectioners' sugar", "preparation": null, "optional": false}], "steps": [{"position": 1, "text": "Mix the raisins with the Cognac and 3 tablespoons of the sugar in a small saucepan and set aside."}, {"position": 2, "text": "Mix the yeast with ¼ cup of the milk in a large bowl and set in a warm place for about 5 minutes, until it becomes frothy. Stir in the remaining milk and sugar. Add the salt and 2 cups of the flour."}, {"position": 3, "text": "Beat the dough by hand or machine, adding all but ¾ cup of the flour. Beat in all but 1 tablespoon of the butter, a tablespoon at a time. Knead in enough of the remaining flour to make a dough that is soft but not sticky and is very elastic. Kneading should take 2 to 3 minutes by machine, or about 6 minutes by hand."}, {"position": 4, "text": "Heat the raisin mixture and cook just until most of the Cognac has evaporated."}, {"position": 5, "text": "Place the dough on a lightly floured surface and pat into a flattened rectangle. Spread the raisins on it, fold the dough over and knead a couple of minutes by hand to incorporate the raisins."}, {"position": 6, "text": "Heavily butter a two-quart kugelhopf pan or a 10-inch bundt pan with the remaining tablespoon of butter and sprinkle with the almonds, turning the pan so they adhere to its interior. Place the dough in the pan, breaking a hole in the center to accommodate the tube. Set aside, lightly covered, and let rise 1 ½ to 2 hours."}, {"position": 7, "text": "Punch dough down in the pan. Let rise again, 45 minutes to 1 hour."}, {"position": 8, "text": "Preheat oven to 375 degrees. Bake the cake for about 45 minutes, until nicely browned. Allow it to cool completely in the pan, then unmold. Dust with sifted confectioners' sugar before serving."}], "nutrition": {"calories": 371.8, "protein_g": 7.7, "carbohydrates_g": 51.8, "fat_g": 14.4, "saturated_fat_g": 6.4, "trans_fat_g": 0.0, "cholesterol_mg": 26.1, "sodium_mg": 141.7, "fiber_g": 3.0, "sugar_g": 19.4, "unsaturated_fat_g": 7.0, "source": "nyt", "basis": "per_serving", "computed_with": null}, "tags": {"cuisine": ["austrian", "eastern european", "german"], "diet": ["vegetarian"], "course": ["dessert"], "meal": [], "occasion": [], "other": ["almond", "bake", "cognac", "raisin"]}, "images": [], "rating": {"average": 4.0, "count": 31}, "video_url": null, "comment_count": null, "published_at": "1989-07-26", "scraped_at": "2026-09-07T05:49:39.593850+00:00", "scraper_version": "1.0.0"}
